Use RTK for noisy command output.

Prefer:

- rtk git status
- rtk git diff --stat
- rtk git diff --name-only
- rtk git diff
- rtk git log
- rtk npm test
- rtk npm run build
- rtk cargo test
- rtk cargo clippy

Avoid:

- huge raw logs
- full file dumps
- full diffs unless necessary
- colored output
- timestamp-heavy output
- repeated broad repo scans

Use deterministic command shapes where possible.

## Serena Usage

Use Serena for semantic code navigation before broad grep/read operations.

Prefer Serena for:

- finding symbols
- finding references
- inspecting call sites
- tracing API route to service/database logic
- targeted edits
- refactor impact analysis

