- capture-sensitive surface classification
- capture policy result shapes
- package-local capture policy tests

## Do not do
- implement native platform channels
- mutate app or core state
- store private ledger or receipt payloads
- promise capture prevention beyond platform limits

Follow `docs/CAPTURE_POLICY.md`.
